<div class="data-services-page">
  <h1>APIs & SPARQL Endpoints</h1>

  <p>The UK Parliament publishes parliamentary data through APIs available at <a href="https://developer.parliament.uk/">developer.parliament.uk</a>, covering Members, divisions (votes), bills, questions, and committee activity.</p>

  <h2>APIs</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://hansard-api.parliament.uk/swagger/ui/index">Hansard API</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://data.parliament.uk/membersdataplatform/default.aspx">Members Data Platform</a>
      <p>An established API with some different functionality than the Developer Hub version.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      Simple REST APIs are available for datasets within <a href="https://data.parliament.uk/">data.parliament.uk</a>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>SPARQL Endpoints</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="https://api.parliament.uk/sparql">Treaties and Statutory Instruments</a>
      <p>Provides richer data than the equivalent API.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://data-odp.parliament.uk/sparql">Parliamentary Search</a>
      <p>In development. Will provide cross-cutting access to subject-indexed data.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
